WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:08.500
Staff member reviewing incoming online mailbox registration application on computer screen.

2
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:16.500
A customer receives an activation email on mobile phone and taps the verification link.

3
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.500
The official Concord Township mailing address and PMB suite number appear on screen.

4
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:34.500
Welcome email displayed showing store operating hours and acceptable identification forms.

5
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:46.500
Delivery driver hands packages to staff. Staff signs receipt and logs packages in secure package vault.

6
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:53.500
Customer presents government photo ID at front counter to verify identity and collect packages.

7
00:00:54.500 --> 00:01:02.500
Animation showing new PMB address updated across online utility accounts and merchant profiles.

8
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:09.500
Mailbox Plus storefront exterior view with customer leaving with retrieved packages.
